{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","author_sig":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","data":{"fields":{"description":"## Context / Problem\nReconciler unit-test cases and fixtures under `tests/unit/rebar_reconciler/` contain confirmed comment or docstring bloat from the audit pinned to `9e65567b79ffe872534c3c656ade7b34340d8192`. File-specific constraints must survive consolidation.\n\n## Approach\nDelegate remediation to bounded directory/subsystem leaf cohorts. Each leaf edits only its declared paths, preserves the requirements recorded in its Scope, and supplies the authoritative file-impact set. Responsibilities remain non-overlapping, and each change stays reviewable in one session.\n\n## Scope\n- Direct container edits: none; repository edits belong to the leaf cohorts.\n- Delegated repository area: Reconciler unit-test cases and fixtures under `tests/unit/rebar_reconciler/`.\n\n## Acceptance Criteria\n- [ ] Every migrated path in this workstream appears in exactly one leaf Scope; verified by the migration inventory.\n- [ ] Every migrated path appears in exactly one matching file-impact record; verified by the migration inventory.\n- [ ] Each path retains every current constraint listed by its leaf Scope; verified by the leaf row-by-row completion comment.\n- [ ] Each path retains its listed consumer contract; verified by the leaf row-by-row completion comment.\n- [ ] Redundant or historical prose identified by the leaf Scope is removed; verified by the leaf row-by-row completion comment.\n- [ ] Each leaf verification command exits 0 before that leaf closes.\n\n## Child decomposition\nEach directory/subsystem cohort owns all criteria for its exact path set. Cohort path sets are disjoint; their union is this workstream scope."}},"env_id":"b8a354e0-12c3-4cf2-bbf1-fcc9685d5126","event_type":"EDIT","timestamp":1788586328517073001,"uuid":"6cadb507-4fc1-45de-9f84-1c3bc9347d31"}